es":["https://youtu.be/gTsfR5PxAMY?t=1851","https://youtu.be/gTsfR5PxAMY?t=1459"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"31.5. He enters the season healthy after a full offseason, and one expert sees about 33 minutes. A weak preseason keeps me a bit below that.","sources":["https://youtu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=1131","https://youtu.be/bd8GYKFOe8A?t=747"]},{"field":"gp","text":"Yahoo's 49 is kept. It already reflects his repeated knee surgeries and sitting every back-to-back, and experts expect 40 to 50 games.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gTsfR5PxAMY?t=490","https://youtu.be/KqTKVExQGLo?t=889"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"One extra game of knee management before the NBA playoffs. Note that he will likely skip the back-to-backs in fantasy weeks 20 and 21.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=1148"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}